NOAA-GSL pygraf colour tables
----------------------------
Earlier releases included a maximum-updraft colour table in
sharpmod/providers/hrrr_products.py adapted from the RGB recipes and
thresholds in adb_graphics/specs.py and adb_graphics/default_specs.yml:
https://github.com/NOAA-GSL/pygraf
