MetPy-compatible ECAPE calculations
==================================

The ECAPE workspace in src/ecape follows the thermodynamic and interpolation
conventions in MetPy 1.7.1. Portions are adapted from its calculation routines:
https://github.com/Unidata/MetPy/tree/v1.7.1/src/metpy/calc

